    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Achieving yet another milestone, the Aga Khan University Hospital won 10th Annual Environment Excellence Award 2013. The Award Distribution Ceremony was held on Friday, July 5, 2013 at Marriot Hotel, Karachi. Dr. Mirza Ikhtiar Baig, Former Advisor of Prime Minister for Textile and Mr. Sohail Wajahat Siddiqui, Former Federal Minister for Petroleum were the Chief Guests.",
